    {
      "key": "gg.hv.receiver",
      "title": "Hardened Receiver",
      "tier": "HV",
      "desc": "The Hardened Receiver is the frame of every serious HV rifle. The SCAR, Vector, AS50, LMG and later the Minigun and Laser Rifle are all built around one, so make a few before you start on guns.\n\nCraft it in an HV Assembler from three stainless steel plates, two stainless steel screws and a Mechanical Parts T2. Press R on the receiver in NEI for the exact recipe.\n\n[note]The AUG takes the plainer Steel Receiver instead, so it is the one rifle you can build without this part.[/note]",
