    {
      "key": "gg.hv.infiltrator",
      "title": "The Infiltrator",
      "tier": "HV",
      "desc": "The Infiltrator is a suppressed M4. It plays a muffled shot sound instead of the M4's crack, which is easier on your ears and your neighbors.\n\nYou do not build it from scratch: put an M4 Assault Rifle in the HV Assembler with two stainless steel plates, two rubber plates, a long stainless steel rod and two glass lenses. The rubber and rod are the suppressor.\n\n[note]The M4 is used up, and the Infiltrator comes out fresh: its loaded rounds and camo skin do not carry over.[/note]",
