      "desc": "The AS50 is an anti-materiel sniper rifle with a heavy zoom. It trades rate of fire for a hit that deletes most things at long range, and it makes quick work of armored targets.\n\nBuild it in the HV Assembler from two Hardened Steel Barrels, a Hardened Receiver, a Plastic Gun Stock, a diamond lens and stainless steel plates, screws and springs. Empty AS50 magazines are made first, then loaded with high caliber rounds in the Ammo Press.\n\nThe quest wants the rifle and one loaded magazine.",
