      "key": "gg.hv.grenade_launcher",
      "title": "Grenade Launcher",
      "tier": "HV",
      "desc": "The grenade launcher lobs the 40 mm grenades you learned to make at MV. It is the cheapest way to clear a room, and a good tool for a mob that keeps its distance.\n\nBuild it in the HV Assembler from a Hardened Steel Barrel, a Steel Receiver, a Plastic Gun Stock, and stainless steel plates, screws and springs. Press R over it in NEI for the full list. Grenades are the ammo, so carry a few.\n\n[note]Explosions hurt creatures, but on servers that keep the explosions.blockDamage setting off they leave the terrain alone.[/note]",
