    {
      "key": "gg.hv.rocket_launcher",
      "title": "Rocket Launcher",
      "tier": "HV",
      "desc": "A shoulder-fired launcher for the moments when a grenade is not enough. It comes empty, so every rocket you fire comes from your own stock.\n\nBuild it in the HV Assembler from two Hardened Steel Barrels, a Steel Receiver, a small stainless steel pipe, and stainless steel plates and screws. NEI has the full recipe.\n\nKeep your distance: the blast radius is real, and a rocket at point-blank range will hurt you too.\n\n[note]With explosions.blockDamage off, a default server keeps its terrain safe. Creatures still take the full hit.[/note]",
      "pre": [
        "gg.hv.rocket_ammo",
        "gg.hv.grenade_launcher"
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
