      "title": "Fuel Tank",
      "tier": "HV",
      "desc": "The Fuel Tank is the ammo for two HV weapons, the Flamethrower and the Chainsaw. It holds 1,000 mB of fuel, and a Fluid Canner fills it for you.\n\nBuild four tanks at a time in the HV Assembler from a stainless steel Large Fluid Cell, two stainless steel plates and two rubber plates. The Large Fluid Cell is a GregTech item, so check NEI for it.\n\n[note]It takes diesel, gasoline, biodiesel or ethanol. A full tank is 100 flamethrower rounds or 300 chainsaw rounds.[/note]",
