      "title": "Flamethrower",
      "tier": "HV",
      "desc": "Fire is the cheapest damage per tank, and the Flamethrower sets fire to anything it touches. It is wonderful against crowds and nasty in a corridor.\n\nBuild it in the HV Assembler from a Pump Mechanism, an Iron Receiver, a Plastic Gun Stock, four Kanthal fine wires (the igniter coil), a small stainless steel pipe, and stainless steel plates and screws. A Fuel Tank is the ammo.\n\n[warn]It burns whatever it points at, and the target can be your ally. Mind who is in front of you.[/warn]",
